# Kanban plan cards

When a feature file has frontmatter `labels` including **`plan`** (case-insensitive), follow
[kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Plan cards and
[reference.md § Plan cards](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md#plan-cards).
Signature: `kanban-cursor-mode-gates`.

## User provides

- `## Description` (required) — problem or roadmap question
- `## Feature Areas` (optional)

## Agent provides

- `## Recommendation` — **on card only after** `plan approved` / `approved` / `update …` / rare
  `plan and update` (not during **`Plan @card`** — that phase is chat-only in **Plan Mode**)
- `## Product Paths` / **Product Methods** — optional when Feature Areas set or when spawning
- `## Spawned …` tables — after user asks to spawn follow-up cards

**Do not** use **Decisions**, **Corrective Action**, or **Acceptance Criteria** on plan cards.

## Cursor mode gate

**`Plan @card`** requires **Plan Mode**. Research and structured plan output stay **in chat** until
the user approves. Wrong Cursor mode → **stop**; instruct user to switch to Plan Mode and retry.

Canonical matrix: [reference.md § Cursor mode gates](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md#cursor-mode-gates-plan--inquire--verbs).

## Workflow

1. Confirm **Description** present
2. Resolve **Feature Areas** → **Product** scope when areas are set (optional pre-spawn)
3. `todo` → `in-progress` → **`Plan @card`** (Plan Mode) — discuss roadmap in chat; **no** card edits
4. User approves → **`update @plan-card`** / `plan approved` / `approved` (Agent) → write
   **Recommendation** on card → `review`
5. User asks to spawn → create **todo** child cards (`feature` / `bug` / `agent` / `inquiry` / `plan`)
   with epic + review-ready sections; link from **`## Spawned feature cards`** (same table pattern
   as inquiry)
6. User or agent moves plan → `done` when satisfied — **no** Card Done lessons or forward feedback

**Rare:** `plan and update @plan-card` — Plan Mode exploration + **Recommendation** same turn
(reference § Cursor mode gates).

## Spawn follow-ups

When the user requests implementation of plan recommendations, spawn **todo** child cards per
[kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Spawn from inquiry (same table
pattern):

- `status: "todo"`, appropriate `labels`, `epic: "{EpicName}"`
- Body: type-appropriate sections (**Decisions** / **Corrective Action** / **Response** / **Recommendation**
  per label — not on parent plan card)
- Parent plan: **`## Spawned feature cards`** table + bump `modified`
- Example: plan `render-bed-2026-06-27` → epic `OrbitFunctionalFaceTextures` bug a0/a1 — reference
  § Spawn from plan (OrbitFunctionalFaceTextures example)

Do **not** start implementation on spawned cards until user assigns work.

## Card Done

**Do not** run lessons learned or forward feedback when closing a **plan** card. Plan **Done** =
move to `done/` only ([kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc) §4).

## Do not

- Write **Recommendation** during **`Plan @card`** without approval path
- Implement application code on the plan card — spawn **feature** / **bug** / **agent** cards instead
- Use **Response** (inquiry section) on plan cards
- Spawn cards in **Backlog** — always **todo**

## Full workflow

See `.cursor/skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md` § Plan cards for template and example
**Recommendation**.
